==English==

===Proper noun===
'''Samantha'''
# A female [[given name]] of [[American]] origin; the female form of [[Samuel]] (possibly influenced by [[Anthea]]). Samantha also means, "Good Listener." And a person named Samantha is known to be very thoughtful and kind towards others.

